---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Launch Assessment | Launch Baseball"><main><section class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">The Launch Assessment</p><h1>Leave with a blueprint.</h1><p>The website teaches the principles. The assessment shows how those principles apply to your player.</p></div></section><section class="paper"><div class="container layout"><div><h2>What the player learns</h2><p>What is already working and should be maintained.</p><p>What is currently limiting performance.</p><p>What should be addressed first—and what can wait.</p><p>Which cues and drills fit the player, and why.</p><p>How to recognize progress and self-adjust.</p></div><aside><p class="eyebrow">Player Blueprint</p><h3>Specific to the player.</h3><p>A clear written direction for continued work, including strengths to maintain, the highest-priority limitation, and the next steps.</p></aside></div></section><section class="dark"><div class="container layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Remote follow-up</p><h2>Coaching does not have to end at the cage.</h2></div><div><p>Using OnForm, players can share video, receive visual analysis, ask questions, and get feedback as they continue working.</p></div></div></section><section class="book" id="book"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2>Book a Launch Assessment.</h2><p>Scheduling and final pricing are being finalized.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:info@launchbaseball.net?subject=Launch Assessment Request">Request an Assessment</a></div></section></main><style>.hero{padding:7rem 0 6rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 20%,rgba(211,41,47,.24),transparent 28%),linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),var(--navy2))}.hero h1{margin:.4rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,8rem);text-transform:uppercase}.hero p:last-child{max-width:760px;color:#bcc7d1;font-size:1.2rem}.paper{padding:7rem 0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .85fr;gap:5rem}.layout h2{margin-top:0;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,4.8rem);text-transform:uppercase}.paper p,.dark p{font-size:1.08rem}.paper aside{padding:1.5rem;background:white;border-left:5px solid var(--red)}.paper aside h3{margin:.4rem 0 1rem;font-size:2rem;text-transform:uppercase}.dark{padding:7rem 0;background:#0a213b}.book{padding:7rem 0;text-align:center;background:#06111f}.book p:not(.eyebrow){color:#aebbc7;margin-bottom:2rem}@media(max-width:760px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}</style></BaseLayout>
